OL,3,GNEWSAWhat is next for Winchester lido
OL,4,Acampaign?
OL,5,
OL,6,FWinchester is set to get a new lido
OL,7,Fafter years of campaigning by
OL,8,Fresidents.
OL,10,FSea Lanes, the company behind
OL,11,FBrighton's popular lido, has been
OL,12,Fchosen to redevelop the former River
OL,13,FPark Leisure Centre site under a
OL,14,F250-year lease agreed by Winchester
OL,15,FCity Council's cabinet.
OL,17,FThe decision follows a long-running
OL,18,Fcampaign for outdoor swimming in the
OL,19,Fcity, backed by a petition that
OL,20,Fgathered thousands of signatures.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,337,330,200,160,0,100
